@sld_membership_machine
title: Every County Has a Chair
subtitle: Turn SLD's surviving offices, councillors and assets into a disciplined membership machine.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: poland_party_card
frequency: 170
view-if: continuous_campaign = 1 and sld_partocracy_stage >= 3 and month_actions < max_month_actions and poland_sld_membership_timer = 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; poland_sld_membership_timer = -1
card-image: img/poland/cards/local-structures.webp

= Every County Has a Chair

SLD's advantage is not enthusiasm. It is the person who still has a key to an
office, knows the county treasurer and can produce a full candidate list by
Friday. The apparatus wants that fact made into the party's organising model.

Doctrine: **[+ sld_partocracy_doctrine_label +]**. Patronage exposure: **[+
sld_patronage_exposure +]/100**. Public trust: **[+ public_trust +]/100**.

- @sld_membership_discipline
- @sld_membership_open
- @sld_membership_refuse

@sld_membership_discipline
title: Put every local structure under apparatus discipline
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Lists, money and turnout improve; patronage exposure and generational decline deepen.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: A national audit and whip network needs one resource.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; barons_strength += 4; barons_dissent -= 7; local_network += 7; list_confidence += 6; turnout_readiness += 4; leadership_authority += 4; party_unity += 2; sld_patronage_exposure += 8; organiser_energy -= 4; young_support -= 3; progressives_dissent += 4; public_trust -= 3; news_headline = "SLD places every county structure under apparatus discipline"

Membership records, nominations and campaign money now pass through one chain
of command. Nothing is spontaneous and nothing important is forgotten.

- #poland_card_finish

@sld_membership_open
title: Open the county offices to members and local associations
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Keep SLD's infrastructure but loosen the chairs' monopoly over it.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Open meetings and membership recruitment need one resource.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; local_network += 5; organiser_energy += 4; young_support += 2; party_unity += 2; public_trust += 2; barons_strength += 1; barons_dissent += 5; sld_patronage_exposure -= 3; progressives_dissent -= 2; news_headline = "SLD opens its county offices to members and civic groups"

The rooms, printers and councillors remain. Regional chairs lose the right to
decide alone who may use them.

- #poland_card_finish

@sld_membership_refuse
title: Leave the county machines to manage themselves
subtitle: Free. Avoid another central rule; barons read non-intervention as neglect.
on-arrival: poland_sld_membership_timer = 6; barons_dissent += 7; internal_dissent += 3; list_confidence -= 2; local_network -= 1; party_unity -= 1; news_headline = "SLD leaves its county machines without a common organising settlement"

Every region keeps its habits. That means flexibility in strong counties and
personal fiefdoms everywhere else.

- #poland_card_finish


@sld_state_memory
title: The People Who Remember the State
subtitle: Decide whether SLD's institutional memory is experience, nostalgia or a liability.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: poland_party_card
