card-image: img/poland/cards/faction-congress.webp

= The People Who Remember the State

Retired ministers, mayors and officials offer a school for candidates who have
never run an institution. Younger members ask whether the lesson is public
administration or obedience to the people who once controlled it.

Doctrine: **[+ sld_partocracy_doctrine_label +]**. Barons dissent: **[+
barons_dissent +]/100**. Young support: **[+ young_support +]/100**.

- @sld_memory_claim
- @sld_memory_school
- @sld_memory_refuse

@sld_memory_claim
title: Claim institutional continuity as SLD's political identity
subtitle: Experienced cadres, pensions and secular government return to the stage; younger currents recoil.
on-arrival: barons_strength += 4; barons_dissent -= 8; pensioner_support += 5; public_sector_support += 4; institutional_trust += 3; public_mood_pending_secular_state_left_ownership += 4; pzpr_history_concessions -= 1; list_confidence += 3; progressives_dissent += 5; razem_dissent += 3; young_support -= 3; public_trust -= 1; news_headline = "SLD claims institutional continuity as a governing virtue"

The party says openly that experience acquired before and after 1989 belongs
to the republic rather than to an archive of permanent apologies.

- #poland_card_finish

@sld_memory_school
title: Teach administration without restoring the old hierarchy
subtitle: A professional school preserves competence and excludes patronage from the curriculum.
on-arrival: administrative_capacity += 5; government_delivery += 2; public_trust += 3; institutional_trust += 2; barons_dissent += 3; sld_patronage_exposure -= 2; young_support += 2; media_capacity += 1; news_headline = "SLD turns its institutional memory into an open school of government"

Former officeholders teach budgets, councils and ministries. Admission is
open, assessments are published and no lecture carries a nomination promise.

- #poland_card_finish

@sld_memory_refuse
title: Retire the old cadres from public party life
subtitle: Free. Gain generational space; the apparatus treats it as repudiation.
on-arrival: poland_sld_memory_timer = 7; young_support += 3; progressive_credibility += 2; public_trust += 1; barons_dissent += 9; barons_strength -= 2; list_confidence -= 3; administrative_capacity -= 1; news_headline = "Lewica retires SLD's old governing cadre from public party life"

The next convention has younger faces and fewer people who know what happens
after a minister signs a decision.

- #poland_card_finish


@wiosna_open_party
