= Taxpayers Are Workers Too

Market Left organisers want the party to speak about forms, contributions and
administrative risk as questions of freedom. Labour organisers answer that a
taxpayer identity often forgets the worker employed by one.

Market Left support: **[+ market_liberal_support +]/100**. Union trust: **[+
union_trust +]/100**. KO relation: **[+ ko_relation +]/100**.

- @market_taxpayers_freedom
- @market_taxpayers_security
- @market_taxpayers_refuse

@market_taxpayers_freedom
title: Adopt tax simplicity and economic freedom as party language
subtitle: Market Left gains ownership of the economic line; organised labour and socialist currents revolt.
