@populist_sovereignty_refuse
title: Reject the two-capitals story
subtitle: Free. Protect European credibility; SPS calls the leadership metropolitan dependants.
on-arrival: poland_populist_sovereignty_timer = 8; social_patriot_dissent += 9; social_patriot_support -= 2; sld_populist_international_isolation -= 4; ko_relation += 3; p2050_relation += 2; universal_solidarity += 2; rural_support -= 3; news_headline = "Lewica rejects SPS's revolt against Brussels and Warsaw"

The distinction survives. So does the suspicion that the people explaining it
live much closer to one capital than their audience does.

- #poland_card_finish


@populist_miller_live
title: Miller Live
subtitle: Give the wacky SLD restoration a permanent unscripted broadcast.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: poland_party_card
frequency: 170
view-if: continuous_campaign = 1 and sld_populist_route_active = 1 and sld_populist_settlement_stage >= 4 and month_actions < max_month_actions and poland_populist_live_timer = 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; poland_populist_live_timer = -1
card-image: img/poland/cards/tv-studio.webp

= Miller Live

Miller proposes a nightly stream with callers, market traders and no approved
questions. The communications team asks whether the word "no" applies to him
or only to the questions.

Media salience: **[+ sld_populist_media_salience +]/100**. Factional capture:
**[+ sld_populist_factional_capture +]/100**.

- @populist_live_open
- @populist_live_delay
- @populist_live_refuse

@populist_live_open
title: Put Miller live and unfiltered
subtitle: Reach and social-patriot power explode; every improvisation becomes party policy.
on-arrival: social_patriot_support += 9; social_patriot_strength += 4; social_patriot_dissent -= 8; sld_populist_media_salience += 14; sld_populist_factional_capture += 10; media_capacity += 7; anti_system_trust += 5; pensioner_support += 4; rural_support += 3; public_trust -= 3; progressives_dissent += 8; razem_dissent += 7; party_unity -= 3; news_headline = "Miller goes live without scripts or delay"

The programme is funny, furious and impossible to correct before tomorrow's
programme makes the correction another grievance.

- #poland_card_finish

@populist_live_delay
title: Give the broadcast a producer and a delay
subtitle: Gain attention while limiting the faction's control over the party line.
on-arrival: social_patriot_support += 5; social_patriot_strength += 2; social_patriot_dissent -= 3; sld_populist_media_salience += 7; sld_populist_factional_capture += 2; media_capacity += 4; pensioner_support += 2; public_trust += 1; progressives_dissent += 3; news_headline = "Miller launches a produced nightly call-in show"

The callers are real and the red light has a seven-second head start.

- #poland_card_finish

@populist_live_refuse
title: Keep Miller inside the common media plan
subtitle: Free. Preserve message control; SPS builds its own channel and grievance.
on-arrival: poland_populist_live_timer = 7; social_patriot_dissent += 10; social_patriot_support -= 2; sld_populist_media_salience += 2; sld_populist_factional_capture -= 2; leadership_authority += 3; media_capacity -= 2; internal_dissent += 4; news_headline = "Lewica refuses Miller an unscripted nightly broadcast"

The party keeps one message. Miller keeps the account passwords his organisers
registered last week.

- #poland_card_finish
